data_ideal_NaD
# Synthetic ideal rocksalt NaD for neutron scattering contrast.
# The 4.88 Angstrom cell is illustrative; no isotope-dependent relaxation
# or measured/DFT intensities are implied. D explicitly means deuterium.
_cell_length_a 4.88
_cell_length_b 4.88
_cell_length_c 4.88
_cell_angle_alpha 90
_cell_angle_beta 90
_cell_angle_gamma 90
_space_group_IT_number 225
